<div dir=3D"ltr"><div><span style=3D"background-color:transparent;font-fami=
ly:&quot;times new roman&quot;,serif;text-align:justify">Dear Students,=C2=
=A0</span></div><div><span style=3D"background-color:transparent;font-famil=
y:&quot;times new roman&quot;,serif;text-align:justify"><br></span></div><d=
iv class=3D"gmail_quote gmail_quote_container"><div dir=3D"ltr"><p class=3D=
"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin:0in;text-align:justify;font-size:10.5pt;font-fa=
mily:&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif">We are pleased to share the information a=
bout=C2=A0<b>Global South-Japan Tech Talent Internship (GS-JTI)</b>, a prog=
ram funded by Japan=E2=80=99s=C2=A0<b>Ministry of Economy, Trade and Indust=
ry (METI)</b>.</p>

<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin:0in;text-align:justify;font-size:10.=
5pt;font-family:&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif">The GS-JTI program offers stud=
ents and recent graduates from
eligible countries the opportunity to take part in internships with Japanes=
e
companies in advanced technology fields, including=C2=A0<b>IT, AI, and
semiconductors</b>. The program is designed to support practical skills
development, international exposure, and cross-cultural engagement through
real-world industry experience.</p>

<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin:0in;text-align:justify;font-size:10.=
5pt;font-family:&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif">Through this internship, parti=
cipants will have the
opportunity to:</p>

<ul style=3D"margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in" type=3D"disc">
 <li class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin:0in;text-align:justify;font-size:1=
0.5pt;font-family:&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif">Gain
     hands-on experience with Japanese companies</li>
 <li class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin:0in;text-align:justify;font-size:1=
0.5pt;font-family:&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif">Learn
     about Japanese workplace culture and business practices</li>
 <li class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin:0in;text-align:justify;font-size:1=
0.5pt;font-family:&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif">Contribute
     to projects in technology-related fields</li>
 <li class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin:0in;text-align:justify;font-size:1=
0.5pt;font-family:&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif">Build
     cross-cultural communication and professional skills</li>
 <li class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin:0in;text-align:justify;font-size:1=
0.5pt;font-family:&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif">Explore
     potential future career opportunities in Japan</li>
</ul>

<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin:0in;text-align:justify;font-size:10.=
5pt;font-family:&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif"><b>=C2=A0</b></p>

<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin:0in;text-align:justify;font-size:10.=
5pt;font-family:&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif"><b>Program Format</b></p>

<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin:0in;text-align:justify;font-size:10.=
5pt;font-family:&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif">The program offers both:</p>

<ul style=3D"margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in" type=3D"disc">
 <li class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin:0in;text-align:justify;font-size:1=
0.5pt;font-family:&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif"><b>On-site
     internships in Japan</b>: approximately=C2=A0<b>1.5 months</b>=C2=A0be=
tween=C2=A0<b>September
     2026 and February 2027</b></li>
 <li class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin:0in;text-align:justify;font-size:1=
0.5pt;font-family:&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif"><b>Online
     internships</b>: approximately=C2=A0<b>1 month</b>=C2=A0during the sam=
e
     period</li>
</ul>

<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin:0in;text-align:justify;font-size:10.=
5pt;font-family:&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif"><i>Internship duration and for=
mat are subject to host
company arrangements.</i></p>

<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin:0in;text-align:justify;font-size:10.=
5pt;font-family:&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif">=C2=A0</p>

<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin:0in;text-align:justify;font-size:10.=
5pt;font-family:&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif"><b>Eligibility</b></p>

<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin:0in;text-align:justify;font-size:10.=
5pt;font-family:&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif">Applicants must:</p>

<ul style=3D"margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in" type=3D"disc">
 <li class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin:0in;text-align:justify;font-size:1=
0.5pt;font-family:&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif">Be
     majoring in=C2=A0<b>STEM-related fields</b>, such as IT, AI, and
     semiconductors</li>
 <li class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin:0in;text-align:justify;font-size:1=
0.5pt;font-family:&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif">Be=C2=A0<b>currently
     enrolled in a university</b>=C2=A0or have=C2=A0<b>graduated within the
     last three years</b></li>
 <li class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin:0in;text-align:justify;font-size:1=
0.5pt;font-family:&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif">Have=C2=A0<b>working
     proficiency in English</b></li>
 <li class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin:0in;text-align:justify;font-size:1=
0.5pt;font-family:&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif">Be
     a=C2=A0<b>citizen of a country listed on the OECD DAC List</b><br>
     <i>(excluding the People=E2=80=99s Republic of China)</i></li>
 <li class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin:0in;text-align:justify;font-size:1=
0.5pt;font-family:&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif">Be=C2=A0<b>residing
     outside Japan</b>=C2=A0at the time of application</li><li class=3D"Mso=
Normal" style=3D"margin:0in;text-align:justify;font-size:10.5pt;font-family=
:&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif"><br></li></ul>

<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin:0in;text-align:justify;font-size:10.=
5pt;font-family:&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif"><b>Participant Support</b></p>

<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin:0in;text-align:justify;font-size:10.=
5pt;font-family:&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif">Support for the eligible parti=
cipants includes:</p>

<ul style=3D"margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in" type=3D"disc">
 <li class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin:0in;text-align:justify;font-size:1=
0.5pt;font-family:&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif">Travel
     and accommodation assistance</li>
 <li class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin:0in;text-align:justify;font-size:1=
0.5pt;font-family:&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif">Visa
     application support</li>
 <li class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin:0in;text-align:justify;font-size:1=
0.5pt;font-family:&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif">24/7
     support during the internship period</li>
</ul>

<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin:0in;text-align:justify;font-size:10.=
5pt;font-family:&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif">=C2=A0</p>

<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin:0in;text-align:justify;font-size:10.=
5pt;font-family:&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif">Past participant feedback has =
also been positive, with
program materials indicating that=C2=A0<b>94% of interns expressed interest=
 in
working for Japanese companies after completing the internship</b>.</p>

<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin:0in;text-align:justify;font-size:10.=
5pt;font-family:&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif">=C2=A0</p>

<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin:0in;text-align:justify;font-size:10.=
5pt;font-family:&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif"><b>Program details:</b><br>
<a href=3D"https://gs-jti.go.jp/foreign-talent/" style=3D"color:rgb(70,120,=
134)" target=3D"_blank">https://gs-jti.go.jp/foreign-talent/</a></p>

<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin:0in;text-align:justify;font-size:10.=
5pt;font-family:&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif"><b>=C2=A0</b></p>

<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin:0in;text-align:justify;font-size:10.=
5pt;font-family:&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif"><b>Registration and applicatio=
n:</b><br>
<a href=3D"https://hub.techjapan.work/register" style=3D"color:rgb(70,120,1=
34)" target=3D"_blank">https://hub.techjapan.work/register</a></p>

<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin:0in;text-align:justify;font-size:10.=
5pt;font-family:&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif">=C2=A0</p>

<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin:0in;text-align:justify;font-size:10.=
5pt;font-family:&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif">For any questions, please feel=
 free to contact the program
office via email below. </p>

<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin:0in;text-align:justify;font-size:10.=
5pt;font-family:&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif">Global South - Japan Tech Tale=
nt Internship (GS-JTI) Program
Secretariat</p>

<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin:0in;text-align:justify;font-size:10.=
5pt;font-family:&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif"><a href=3D"mailto:gs_hr_exchan=
ge_support@tohmatsu.co.jp" style=3D"color:rgb(70,120,134)" target=3D"_blank=
">gs_hr_exchange_support@tohmatsu.co.jp</a></p><p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=
=3D"margin:0in;text-align:justify;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Yu Min=
